{"overview":"\"جعفر پناهی\" و \"مجتبی میرطهماسب\" تلاش می‌کنند تا از طریق به تصویر کشیدن یک روز از زندگی جعفر پناهی، شرایط امروز سینمای ایران را نشان دهند...","tagline":"","overview_en":"Renowned Iranian director Jafar Panahi received a 6-year prison sentence and a 20-year ban from filmmaking and conducting interviews with foreign press due to his open support for the opposition party in Iran's 2009 election. In this film, which was shot secretly by Panahi's close friend Mojtaba Mirtahmasb and smuggled into France on a USB stick concealed inside a cake for a last-minute submission to Cannes, Panahi documents his daily life under house arrest as he awaits a decision on his appeal.","tagline_en":"If we could tell a film, then why make a film?","runtime":78,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Mojtaba Mirtahmasb","جعفر پناهی"],"crew_en":["Mojtaba Mirtahmasb","Jafar Panahi"],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"جعفر پناهی","role":"Self","photo":"/viZZkkfcuWze68bvUiMZmYZe8Qg.jpg","en":"Jafar Panahi"},{"name":"Igi","role":"Pet lizard","photo":""},{"name":"Mrs. Gheirat","role":"Self (voice)","photo":""},{"name":"Mojtaba Mirtahmasb","role":"Self","photo":"/hdr1iWmt4ktjZUGdTIppvtOSzhA.jpg"},{"name":"Rakhsan","role":"Self (voice)","photo":""},{"name":"Sima","role":"Self (voice)","photo":""},{"name":"Micky","role":"Self","photo":""},{"name":"Hasan","role":"Self","photo":""}],"trailer":"AgZy00svH08","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/83552-yn-fylm-nyst/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Kanopy","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/cltb8XKan9ierp23ItPmCOcVLRa.png"},{"n":"Hoopla","kind":"free","logo":"/gtjNBzAoGgUtYzt0UKXmwG34WWL.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/83552-yn-fylm-nyst/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"MUBI","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/k7iSlvgWzZuO4zU5PcBjhABMuia.png"},{"n":"MUBI Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/w1hl8HszsPf5aAGT0mVY0O6LYP4.png"}]},"DE":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/83552-yn-fylm-nyst/watch?l